stateDiagram-v2
 [*] --> Draft
 Draft --> Validating
 Validating --> Rejected: invalid or unsafe
 Validating --> AwaitingApproval: valid
 AwaitingApproval --> Authorized: approved
 AwaitingApproval --> Cancelled
 Authorized --> Dispatched
 Dispatched --> Executing
 Executing --> Paused: fault or operator
 Paused --> Executing: recovery authorized
 Executing --> Completed
 Executing --> Failed
 Completed --> Verifying
 Verifying --> Verified
 Verifying --> ExceptionReview
 Failed --> ExceptionReview
